# Text files stay LF in every checkout, Windows included (Node, the shebang of src/cli.ts and every tool here read LF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.sqlite binary

# harness: append-only records (archives, reconciliation log): when two branches both add lines, git keeps both
# sides instead of reporting a conflict. Never for generated files.
docs/archive/*.md merge=union
